<rml><head><title>GAME FILES</title><link type="text/rcss" href="../../themes/prime.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="../../components/controls.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="native-game-files.rcss"/></head><body><div id="native_setup_panel" class="native_setup_panel"><div class="native_setup_header"><div class="eyebrow">PROJECT PRIME</div><h1>GAME FILES</h1></div><div class="native_setup_body"><p role="group">Choose your own Metroid Prime Hunters cartridge dump. Import starts automatically after you choose a supported file. Project Prime unpacks what it needs and leaves the selected file alone. No game data is included or downloaded.</p><p id="native_setup_files" role="status"/><p id="native_setup_root" role="group" class="native_setup_wrap"/><button id="native_setup_choose" data-action="setup:action:1">CHOOSE CARTRIDGE DUMP</button><button id="native_setup_previews" data-action="setup:action:5">RENDER MISSING MAP PREVIEWS</button><p id="native_setup_progress" role="status"/><p class="native_setup_hint" role="group">Extraction progress follows milestones, not a measured count of remaining files. Map previews are separate optional work.</p><div id="native_setup_log" role="region" aria-label="Installation progress log" class="native_setup_log"/></div><div class="native_setup_footer"><p id="native_setup_status" role="status"/><div class="native_setup_actions"><button id="native_setup_back" data-action="setup:action:0">BACK</button><button id="native_setup_refresh" data-action="setup:action:3">CHECK FILES</button><button id="native_setup_cancel" data-action="setup:action:11">STOP WAITING</button></div></div></div></body></rml>
